<title>UK: Commerzbank sets warrants on 6.25 pct Bund 2024.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets warrants on 6.25 pct Bund 2024.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerzbank AG  has issued 80 million American-style call and put warrants, in eight equal tranches, on the 6.25 pct Bund due 2024, lead manager Commerz Financial Products said.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 15.OCT.96-15.OCT.97   PAYDATE	08.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> WARRANTS		 STRIKE		     ISS PRICE</p>
<p> CALL A		   90.00 PCT		  2.75 DEM</p>
<p> CALL B		   92.00 PCT		  1.78 DEM</p>
<p> CALL C		   94.00 PCT		  1.11 DEM</p>
<p> CALL D		   96.00 PCT		  0.67 DEM</p>
<p> PUT E		    86.00 PCT		  1.88 DEM</p>
<p> PUT F		    88.00 PCT		  2.68 DEM</p>
<p> PUT G		    90.00 PCT		  3.68 DEM</p>
<p> PUT H		    92.00 PCT		  4.88 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
